            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Updates the draft's base revision to match the currently-live revision, applying the draft's changes on top. Supply `conflictResolutions` to resolve any conflicting fields. Valid keys: `defaultValue`, `rules`, `prerequisites`, `archived`, `holdout`, and `environmentsEnabled.<env>`. Unresolved conflicts respond with `409`."
